QuestGuidance.Register("en",212,{
[6753]="70062EAC\n1\tTalk to Eluna\tTalk to Eluna before the negotiation begins.\n2\tWait for Ardhun to arrive\tWait for Ardhun to arrive.\n3\tListen to Eluna and Ardhun's conversation\tListen to Eluna and Ardhun's conversation. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tRemain on guard as more Draig-lûth arrive\tRemain alert.\n5\tDefend Eluna\tYou should defend Eluna\n6\tRegroup with Eluna and her students\tThe fight is over. Regroup with the others.\n7\tTalk to Eluna\tEluna has survived the attempt on her life, thanks in no small part to your valour. You should talk to Eluna.\n",
[6754]="70000134\n1\tTalk to Bounder Boffin (Walk forward by pressing W)\tReturning from your errand, you see that Bounder Boffin has invited three hobbits to share in his fire. The hobbits are travelling to Bree which is a curiosity in of itself.\n2\tSit and listen to the hobbits\tThe hobbits seem to be having a great time. The three strangers are travelling to Bree which is a bit odd for a hobbit but soon the talk of mushrooms distracts you from that worry.\n3\tAt the door to Odo's Farm, speak to Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin thinks it is best to hide until the Black Rider passes by, and he thinks old Odo's leaf-barn could be such a place to hide.\n4\tTake weapons from Bounder Boffin's satchel (Click on the satchel using the right mouse button)\tBounder Boffin has mentioned that you need a weapon before you venture deeper into the Farm. He has brought you to a satchel with a couple weapons.\n5\tTalk to Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin has asked you to spar with him to make sure you are ready for your travels.\n6\tSpeak with Bounder Boffin\tAfter proving yourself, speak to Bounder Boffin to see where he wishes to lead you.\n7\tDefeat spiders (total: 2)\tAfter proving yourself, speak with Bounder Boffin to see where he wishes to lead you.\n8\tSpeak with Bounder Boffin\tYou should let Bounder Boffin know the way is now clear to the next gate. Bounder Boffin asked you to clear the way to the next gate while he watched for the Black Rider's return.\n9\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tWith the way cleared to the next gate, follow Bounder Boffin as he opens it.\n10\tDefeat spiders (total: 3)\tAs Bounder Boffin tries to hack through the spider webs, defend him from the spiders that will surely try to stop him. As you made your way into Old Odo's farm, you found your way barred by spider-webs.\n11\tSpeak to Bounder Boffin\tFollow Bounder Boffin in search of safety. Bounder Boffin found the key to Old Odo's home, but in his haste to open the door, he snapped the key off in the lock.\n12\tTalk to Mundo Sackville-Baggins\tSpeak to the imprisoned hobbit, Mundo and try to help him out of there.\n13\tFree the other hobbits\tThe Spider Queen has awoken. Free Bounder Boffin and the other hobbits from the evil spider.\n14\tFree yourself from the Blackwolds of Archet\tYou find yourself imprisoned by the Blackwolds of Archet. They have put you in their camp. You must find a way to escape.\n15\tSpeak with Strider\tNow that you have been freed, follow Strider to help his fellow ranger Amdir. They will lead you out of this evil camp!\n16\tFlee the Blackwold Camp with Strider\tFlee the Blackwold Camp with Strider.\n17\tTalk to Mundo Sackville-Baggins\tHaving chased away the Nazgul, speak with Mundo Sackville-Baggins.\n",
[6755]="70022EEB\n1\tWalk up the road (Move forwards by pressing W)\tYou are out for a stroll, but someone appears to be on the road ahead (a bit of an occasion for these quiet parts.) You should speak with the fellow on the road ahead of you. Right-click on characters to interact.\n2\tWalk up the road (Move forwards by pressing W)\tYou are out for a stroll, but someone appears to be on the road ahead (a bit of an occasion for these quiet parts.) You should speak with the fellow on the road ahead of you.\n3\tTalk to the fellow on the road (Right-click on the hobbit to interact)\tYou have encountered a rattled Bounder on the road in the Green Hill Country. You should speak with Bounder Boffin to hear what he has to say.\n4\tExamine the satchel on the side of the road (Right-click on the satchel to collect what is inside)\tThe satchel is near Bounder Boffin on the road. You should peek inside the satchel to see if it contains anything that could be useful to you on a dark night like tonight.\n5\tTalk to Bounder Boffin to begin the practice fight (Right-click on the weapon in your inventory to equip it.)\tBounder Boffin wishes to see if you are capable of wielding a blade to defend yourself. You should practice sparring with Bounder Boffin so that you will both feel more confident on the dark road.\n6\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin wishes to patrol the road, for he had an eerie sort of feeling about this night. You should patrol the road with Bounder Boffin.\n7\tDefeat spiders (0/2) (Right-click on a spider to target it in combat. Left-click on your skill icons at the bottom of the screen to use them.)\tThe spiders are in Odo's Leaf Farm. Bounder Boffin is afraid of spiders, and wishes for you to clear the path before he ventures further down.\n8\tDefeat spiders (total: 2) (Right-click on a spider to target it in combat. Left-click on your skill icons at the bottom of the screen to use them.)\tThe spiders are in Odo's Leaf Farm. Bounder Boffin is afraid of spiders and wishes for you to clear the path before he ventures down\n9\tTalk to Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is waiting for you on the path. You should speak with Bounder Boffin before continuing your escape through the farm.\n10\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is waiting for you on the path. You should follow Bounder Boffin to escape the menace on the road.\n11\tDefeat attacking spiders (total: 3)\tBounder Boffin will need protection from spiders as he hacks at their sturdy webs. You should defeat spiders and protect Bounder Boffin while he tries to get you to safety.\n12\tTalk to Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is trying to get to safety through Odo's Leaf Farm. You should follow Bounder Boffin to a safer road, which will lead you both to a nearby town.\n13\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is trying to get to safety through Odo's Leaf Farm. You should follow Bounder Boffin to a safer road, which will lead you both to a nearby town.\n14\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is trying to get to safety through Odo's Leaf Farm. You should follow Bounder Boffin to a safer road, which will lead you both to a nearby town.\n15\tFollow Bounder Boffin\tBounder Boffin is trying to get to safety through Odo's Leaf Farm. You should follow Bounder Boffin to a safer road, which will lead you both to a nearby town.\n16\tTry to get out of your cell\tYou are in a jail cell, surrounded by the brigands who kidnapped you and your fellow hobbits.\n17\tTry to get out of your cell\tYou are in a jail cell, surrounded by the brigands who kidnapped you and your fellow hobbits.\n18\tTalk to Strider\tA mysterious, weather-worn Man is waiting for you in the Brigand jail. You should speak with your rescuer so that he may guide you out of danger.\n19\tLeave the jail (Right-click on doors to open them. Walk into open doors to be ported to your destination.)\tThe door that takes you out of the jail is down the corridor from your jail cell. You should follow Strider out the door of the jail.\n20\tFollow Strider\tAmdir has helped to rescue your friends from the cruel Brigands. You are now supposed to meet up with Strider's companion, a Ranger named Amdir.\n21\tTalk to Strider\tStrider now kneels by his grievously wounded friend, Amdir. You should talk to Strider, for he will best know what to do next.\n",
[6756]="700413C5\n1\tSpeak with Arvaethor.\tYou should speak with Arvaethor.\n2\tDelve to the deepest chamber of the caverns of Nimrond\tDelve to the deepest chamber of the caverns of Nimrond.\n3\tDestroy the dark stones to gain entrance to the inner hall of Nimrond (total: 4)\tDestroy the dark stones to gain entrance to the inner hall of Nimrond.\n4\tDefeat Drugât and Nerzus\tDrugât and Nerzus can be found in the innermost chamber of Nimrond. Defeat Drugât and Nerzus, leaders of the ruthless dead and Orkish forces.\n5\tSpeak with Arvaethor\tSpeak with Arvaethor.\n",
[6757]="700573F4\n1\tTalk to Frethi\tFrethi is ready to begin exploring the chamber. You should talk to Frethi.\n2\tLook around with Frethi\tAre you... imagining this?\n",
[6758]="7000D917\n1\tTalk to Ponto Oats\tPonto Oats is standing on the road that leads down to Dwaling. Ponto is waiting to speak with you about your upcoming \"retrieval\".\n2\tFind the club\tThe club for which you are seeking is on the ground by the sleeping brigands near Pearlina Gamgee's house in Dwaling. Ponto is waiting for you to retrieve the club from near the sleeping brigands in Dwaling.\n3\tTalk to Ponto Oats\tPonto Oats is on the slope at the northern edge of Dwaling. Ponto is waiting to hear about your retrieval of the club.\n",
[6759]="70057381\n1\tTalk to Grímyr\tGrímyr is waiting to speak with you.\n2\tFollow Grímyr\tGrímyr has asked that you follow him to a more discreet location.\n3\tDefend yourself\tGrímyr has suddenly attacked you! You should defend yourself!\n",
[6760]="7006F2A6\n1\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.\n2\tListen to the conversation between Inkanûsh and Cúridwan\tInkanûsh and Cúridwan are in Sul Madásh.\n3\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n4\tListen to the conversation between Inkanûsh and Cúridwan\tInkanûsh and Cúridwan are in Sul Madásh.\n5\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n6\tListen to Glorfindel\tGlorfindel is in Sul Madásh.\n7\tTalk to Inkanûsh in Sul Madásh\tInkanûsh is in Sul Madásh.\n8\tTalk to Cúridwan in Sul Madásh\tCúridwan is in Sul Madásh.\n9\tTalk to Glorfindel in Sul Madásh\tGlorfindel is in Sul Madásh.\n10\tCheck Baharúd for signs of life\tThe Utûgi have been driven away, but they leave sorrow in their wake.\n",
[6761]="70059A20\n1\tImák and Venko wait for you on the hill upon which the Drearspire stands.\t\n2\tFollow Imák and Venko toward the Drearspire\tImák and Venko hope your presence in the Drearspire will go unnoticed as you investigate the Angmarim interest in the tower.\n3\tVenko stands before a side entrance to the Drearspire, considering its suitability for your purpose.\t\n4\tEnter the Drearspire with Imák and Venko\tYou have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko, in search of answers: what villainy have the Angmarim conducted within Câr Bronach?\n5\tYou have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko, in search of answers: what villainy have the Angmarim conducted within Câr Bronach?\t\n6\tExplore the Drearspire with Imák and Venko\tYou have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko and should search the tower for answers.\n7\tTalk to Venko inside the Drearspire\tInside the Drearspire, Venko has called for you to halt.\n8\tEavesdrop on the discussion between the cultists in the Drearspire\tYou have entered the Drearspire with Imák and Venko, and now you have the opportunity to eavesdrop on some of the Angmarim who remain in the tower. Perhaps you will learn what these evil folk seek to accomplish within Câr Bronach, and elsewhere. You must not be seen by the Angmarim cultists. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[6762]="700012A3\n1\tTalk to Leland Underhill\tLeland Underhill is looking to recover something that was stolen from him by brigands. Leland Underhill has asked you to help him.\n2\tProtect Leland Underhill\tLeland Underhill is looking to recover something that was stolen from him by brigands. Leland Underhill has asked you to help him.\n3\tTalk to Leland Underhill\tLeland Underhill is inside the cave hideout of the brigands that stole his lunch. Leland Underhill is waiting to speak with you.\n",
[6763]="7001792D\n1\tTalk to Andrew Oakhurst\tAndrew Oakhurst is behind the line of Wardens south of Bree-town. Warden Oakhurst is waiting to speak with you.\n2\tTalk to Toby Thorndyke\tToby Thorndyke is at your place in the line of Wardens defending Bree-town from attack from the south. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Andrew Oakhurst\tAndrew Oakhurst is behind the line of Wardens south of Bree-town. The attack has been successfully repelled, and you should speak now to Warden Oakhurst.\n",
[6764]="7002BFFE\n1\tFight your way through the first ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.\t\n2\tFight through the second ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.\t\n3\tFight through the third ward of Lashkarg and defeat its captain.\t\n4\tFight through the fourth ward of Lashkarg and defeat the commander of the Khundolar.\t\n",
[6765]="70059AC6\n1\tTalk to Glúrkub in the Welkin-lofts\tGlúrkub stands among the trees not far from the hiding place you scouted. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n2\tTalk to Glúrkub in the hiding spot\tGlúrkub stands in the hiding spot near the path to the mountain's summit. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tListen to Glúrkub explain the plan\tGlúrkub stands in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n4\tAnswer Glúrkub's question: can the goblin trust Prince Durin?\tGlúrkub has asked you if he can trust Prince Durin, and if you think the prince will let him go. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tListen to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub is in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n6\tAnswer Glúrkub's question: what password should he use to call you from hiding if he gets into trouble?\tGlúrkub has asked you what password he should use to call you forth from hiding if he gets into trouble. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n7\tListen to Glúrkub and wait for Gorgar to climb to the peak\tGlúrkub is in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n8\tTalk to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub is in the hiding spot in the Welkin-lofts. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n9\tWatch Glúrkub carry out the plan\tGlúrkub has gone to execute his part of the plan: stealing the mithril hammer from the guards Gorgar left behind. You should remain in the hiding spot and not emerge unless Glúrkub gets into trouble and shouts the password. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n10\tWatch Glúrkub carry out the plan\tGlúrkub has gone to execute his part of the plan: stealing the mithril hammer from the guards Gorgar left behind. You should remain in the hiding spot and not emerge unless Glúrkub gets into trouble and shouts the password. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n11\tTalk to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub has seized the mithril hammer and raced back to the hiding spot, where he waits to speak with you.\n12\tReturn to Prince Durin with Glúrkub and the mithril hammer\tYou and Glúrkub successfully carried out the plan to steal the mithril hammer and should now return to Prince Durin.\n13\tTalk to Prince Durin\tGlúrkub has delivered the mithril hammer to Prince Durin, as he promised to do. How will the prince now respond?\n14\tTalk to Glúrkub\tGlúrkub has delivered the mithril hammer to Prince Durin, as he promised. The goblin now waits to speak with you.\n15\tEscort Glúrkub from Gundabad\tPrince Durin has commanded that Glúrkub be given safe passage away from Gundabad, and asked you to escort the goblin from Elderslade.\n16\tTalk to Glúrkub outside Gundabad\tYou have safely escorted Glúrkub past the dwarf-lines and out of Gundabad.\n",
[6766]="70000F16\n1\tTalk to Atherol Took\tAtherol Took is crouching at the fence on the edge of Maggot's property, by the road. Atherol is waiting to speak with you about the plan to keep the brigands from stealing Farmer Maggot's mushrooms.\n2\tDefeat Blackwold Mushroom-thief (total: 8)\030Collect some of Maggot's mushrooms (total: 3)\tSome brigands have come to Bamfurlong and may be hiding anywhere around the farm. Atherol Took is waiting for you to get rid of the brigands that are planning to steal Farmer Maggot's mushrooms... and wants you to steal some yourself!\n3\tTalk to Atherol Took\tAtherol Took is waiting at the fence by the road outside of Bamfurlong. Atherol Took is waiting to hear that you have gotten rid of the brigands that were planning to steal Farmer Maggot's mushrooms.\n",
[6767]="7002EFE5\n1\tTalk to Burnoth\tTalk to Burnoth.\n2\tListen to the discussion between the Riders Four and Reeve Fastred\tListen to the discussion between the Riders Four and Reeve Fastred.\n3\tDefeat the Orcs attacking Fastred's camp\tDefeat the Orcs attacking Fastred's camp.\n4\tDefeat Zakrif, the troll-commander of the Orc-company.\t\n5\tTalk to Reeve Fastred\tTalk to Fastred.\n",
[6768]="70020EFB\n1\tTalk to Amarion\tHelp Amarion escape from the Black Dens.\n2\tSpeak with Amarion and return to Echad Dagoras in Fordirith.\t\n",
[6769]="70035B0C\n1\tTalk to Cyneberg\tCyneberg is in the northern High Knolls. You should follow Cyneberg.\n2\tFollow Cyneberg\tCyneberg is in the northern High Knolls. You should follow Cyneberg.\n3\tReassure Thrymm that Cyneberg is all right\tThrymm is in the northern High Knolls. You should speak with Thrymm.\n4\tSee if Cyneberg is feeling better\tThrymm and Cyneberg are in Thrymm's cave in the northern High Knolls.\n5\tListen to Thrymm and Cyneberg\tYou should listen to Thrymm and Cyneberg.\n6\tTalk to Cyneberg\tYou should listen to Thrymm and Cyneberg.\n7\tListen to Cyneberg\tYou should listen to Thrymm and Cyneberg.\n",
[6770]="7000B95E\n1\tTalk to Garbert\tGarbert has already prepared some of the trap, but he still needs your help.\n2\tPlace fish beneath the window\tAdwold is waiting for you to place the fish beneath the window. Adwold has shown you the perfect place to leave the bait for your trap: beneath the large window on the side of Garbert's cottage.\n3\tTalk to Adwold\tAdwold is preparing to lie in wait for the creature to appear. You and Adwold must steel yourselves for the springing of the trap.\n4\tTalk to Adwold\tAdwold is hiding behind the makeshift cover Garbert constructed by his cottage. What was that sound? Adwold is certain he heard something -- could it be the creature?\n5\tGrab the creature at Adwold's signal\tThe sneaking creature has come again to Garbert's cottage, and you and Adwold are ready to spring the trap. Adwold has told you to wait for his signal before jumping out at the creature and trying to seize it.\n6\tChase the sneaking creature through Tâl Bruinen\tThe sneaking creature is escaping through Tâl Bruinen, and you must follow it if you can.\n7\tChase the sneaking creature through Tâl Bruinen\tThe sneaking creature is escaping through Tâl Bruinen, and you must follow it if you can.\n8\tChase the sneaking creature through Tâl Bruinen\tThe sneaking creature is escaping through Tâl Bruinen, and you must follow it if you can.\n9\tChase the sneaking creature through Tâl Bruinen\tThe sneaking creature is escaping through Tâl Bruinen, and you must follow it if you can.\n10\tChase the sneaking creature through Tâl Bruinen\tThe sneaking creature is escaping through Tâl Bruinen, and you must follow it if you can.\n11\tDefeat Udulug\tYou have lost the creature, but encountered an Orc that seems to have been charged with tracking its movements: this is Udulug, of whom the creature spoke. Udulug must be defeated.\n12\tTalk to Adwold\tAdwold has managed to catch up to you despite suffering a leg injury during the chase. Adwold is waiting to hear the results of the chase.\n",
[6771]="70046C4C\n1\tListen to Anborn's tale\tAnborn can be found in Henneth Annûn. Anborn is telling you what he recalls of the night he brought the gangrel-creature to be questioned.\n2\tListen to Anborn's tale\tAnborn can be found in Henneth Annûn. Anborn is telling you what he recalls of the night he brought the gangrel-creature to be questioned.\n",
[6772]="7005B250\n1\tTalk to Molkha\tMolkha is ready to describe what she saw earlier. You should talk to Molkha.\n2\tListen to the conversation\tMolkha is describing what she saw transpire between the drakes, hobgoblins, and Angmarim. You should listen to the conversation.\n",
[6773]="70047294\n1\tTalk to Hrostyr\tHrostyr stands before the throne of King Thorin III.\n2\tListen to the words of Thorin III, King Under the Mountain\tThorin III, King Under the Mountain, addresses the folk of the Lonely Mountain.\n",
[6774]="7004729C\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir in the Court of the Fountain\tMithrandir is in the Court of the Fountain, high atop the city.\n2\tListen to the words of King Elessar in the Court of the Fountain\tKing Elessar is in the Court of the Fountain, atop the city.\n3\tTalk to Malthengil in the Court of the Fountain\tMalthengil, the guard of King Elessar, is in the Court of the Fountain.\n4\tListen further to the words of King Elessar in the Court of the Fountain\tKing Elessar is in the Court of the Fountain, atop the city.\n",
[6775]="70053A34\n1\tTalk to Culang inside the throne room of Barad Cúron\tThe Ranger Culang is in the throne room inside Barad Cúron.\n2\tRemain on guard\tUgrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit, has captured the Ranger Annoth. He comes now to Barad Cúron to challenge Gothmog for supremacy of Imlad Morgul.\n3\tTalk to Ugrukhôr\tUgrukhôr has asked you a question.\n4\tRemain on guard\tUgrukhôr does not have the capacity for mercy. He toys with you and with the lives of your friends.\n5\tTalk to Ugrukhôr\tUgrukhôr does not have the capacity for mercy. He toys with you and with the lives of your friends. He must pay for his cruelty.\n6\tTalk to Lûrkh\tUgrukhôr has commanded one of his guards, an Orc named Lûrkh, to take you on a search of the tower for Karazgar.\n7\tClear the room atop Barad Cúron of merrevail\tLûrkh wants you to clear the room of merrevail while he studies the Oath-stone, pondering if some valuable piece of it might be chipped away and kept as treasure.\n8\tDefeat Lûrkh, and do it quickly\tLûrkh has given all his attention to the Oath-stone in the centre of the chamber. Now is your chance to overpower him!\n9\tDescend Barad Cúron and return to the throne room without alerting Ugrukhôr to your presence\tWith the advantage of surprise on your side, you should descend the tower of Barad Cúron and return to the throne room.\n10\tWait for Culang's signal to attack\tCulang has noticed your return, and now you must wait for his signal to attack. Do not let Ugrukhôr see you before that time!\n11\tWait for Culang's signal to attack\tCulang has noticed your return, and now you must wait for his signal to attack. Do not let Ugrukhôr see you before that time!\n12\tTalk to Ugrukhôr\tUgrukhôr is ready to face you in single combat.\n13\tDefeat Ugrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit\tThe time has come to face Ugrukhôr, the Captain of the Pit, and avenge the lives he has taken.\n",
[6776]="7004EA8A\n1\tSearch for Vaskorn\tThe Ungoledain appear to be ready for an attack. Fight them off as you continue to search for Vaskorn.\n2\tProtect Vaskorn from Ungoledain attackers\tVaskorn appears to be unconscious, but alive.\n3\tDefeat the spider shade\tThe Ungoledain have begun to retreat, but left behind a vicious spider shade to fight you.\n",
[6777]="7006100A\n1\tTalk to Angelica\tAngelica is in her new home: 8 Honeymead Lane, Nobottle.\n2\tCheck the sitting room for Boffins\030Check the kitchen for Boffins\030Check the storage room for Boffins\tAngelica thinks you should check that her siblings are all still here, and haven't gone missing again.\n3\tTalk to Angelica\tAngelica is waiting for your report in her new home.\n4\tTalk to Bingo\tBingo stands in the hallway of Angelica's new burrow, smiling cheerfully.\n5\tSurvive the house-warming party without embarrassment\tA visitor has come to 8 Honeymead Lane during Angelica's house-warming party.\n6\tTalk to Angelica\tAngelica is beside herself with excitement.\n7\tTalk to Prisca\tPrisca is pleased that everything turned out well.\n",
[6778]="70055178\n1\tTalk to Dolenthol\tDolenthol is standing inside Uialrond, the Dome of Evening. You should talk to Dolenthol.\n2\tFollow Dolenthol\tYou should follow Dolenthol into Uialrond, the Dome of Evening.\n3\tYou should search Uialrond and try to discern why it was sealed.\t\n4\tLook down at the council table of Uialrond\030Find a good spot to look down at the council table of Uialrond\tYou should find a good spot to look down at the council table of Uialrond.\n5\tExamine the source of the curious glimmer\tYou should examine the source of the curious glimmer.\n6\tBear witness to the echo of Galadriel\tYou should witness the vision of Galadriel.\n7\tTalk to Faramir\tYou have witnessed the hopeful words of Galadriel, and Dolenthol has revealed himself to be the Lady Éowyn before Prince Faramir in Uialrond. You should talk to Faramir.\n",
[6779]="700579F9\n1\tWalk down the aisle and speak to Aragorn\tThe procession is underway, and King Aragorn Elessar II is waiting for you to walk down the aisle to him, where he has a few words for you.\n2\tStand next to Merry on the southern side of the aisle\tYour place, from where you will have a fine view of the ceremony, is next to Meriadoc Brandybuck on the southern side of the aisle.\n3\tWait for the Elves to take their places as the processional continues\tThe processional continues while the Elves take their places atop the prow.\n4\tListen to Mithrandir's words of welcome\tMithrandir has some words of welcome for the folk assembled atop the pier.\n5\tMourn to remember those who did not live to see this day\tMithrandir has called for a moment of silence to remember those who did not live to see this day.\n6\tListen to Mithrandir's additional words of remembrance\tMithrandir wishes to speak some additional words of remembrance.\n7\tListen to the speeches by honoured guests\tSome honoured guests have asked to speak some words at the ceremony.\n8\tCheer for Sam\tSam has finished reciting his poem, and the assembled crowd cheers for the embarrassed hobbit.\n9\tWatch as Mithrandir continues the ceremony\tThe speeches concluded, Mithrandir continues the wedding ceremony.\n10\tWitness the marriage of King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel\tThe time has come for King Elessar and Arwen Undómiel to exchange their vows, in view of the assembled masses.\n11\tMithrandir's fireworks signal an end to the ceremony, but only the start of the celebration\tMithrandir's fireworks are as impressive as ever, and the celebration will continue long into the night.\n",
[6780]="7004D3D1\n1\tTalk to Oroniel\tTalk to Oroniel.\n2\tDefend yourself!\tDefend yourself.\n3\tHear the stranger speak\tHear what the stranger has to say.\n4\tDefeat Agânuzir\tDefeat Agânuzir.\n",
[6781]="7006C6E8\n1\tJoin Raphûz by the fire\tRaphûz waits for you by the fireside.\n2\tSit with Raphûz by the fireside\tRaphûz invites you to sit and enjoy the warmth of the fire and share stories.\n3\tShare a smoke with Raphûz\tRaphûz compliments you on your generosity and then pauses to smoke.\n4\tContinue to listen to Raphûz\tRaphûz confessed to requesting a move to Khûd Zagin in hopes he would see Ashâmai again.\n5\tTalk to Raphûz\tYou are concerned about Raphûz and his pursuit of Ashâmi.\n6\tNod /yes to Raphûz to acknowledge his words\tRaphûz seems to understand and have his mind in the right place.\n",
[6782]="70037838\n1\tTalk to Arcil\tArcil, Éothain, and others have gathered to discuss the next course of action for Aldburg. You should speak with Arcil.\n2\tObserve the discussion\tThe people of Aldburg have come together to decide how best to deal with the two Orc-tribes that have been causing trouble of late. You should observe the discussion.\n3\tTalk to Arcil\tBoth Arcil and Éothain stated their case about which Orc-tribe poses the greatest threat. You speak with Arcil once again.\n",
[6783]="700537DA\n1\tTalk to Vëamacil\tVëamacil and Ornaher are outside the walls of Amon Fuin.\n2\tTalk to Magoldir outside Amon Fuin\tYou and the sons of Isildur have encountered Magoldir the Elf outside Amon Fuin.\n3\tMagoldir wants you to advise Vëamacil and Ornaher to abandon their mission to Amon Fuin.\t\n4\tTalk to Magoldir outside Amon Fuin\tThe sons of Isildur have charged forward into Amon Fuin, dismissing the warnings of Magoldir.\n5\tDefeat the guards that defend Urudanî Stonemaiden\tUrudanî Stonemaiden commands the Mordorrim cultists within Amon Fuin.\n6\tTalk to Urudanî Stonemaiden in Amon Fuin\tUrudanî's cultists have been defeated, and her contingent of Orcs has abandoned her, but she still intends to stand and fight.\n7\tStand alongside Magoldir and the sons of Isildur in Amon Fuin\tThe sons of Isildur weigh what should be done with Urudanî Stonemaiden. She has been defeated, but while she lives she remains a threat to the Great Alliance.\n",
[6784]="70030691\n1\tTalk to Inhild\tInhild can be found along the road to Randgar's farm. Inhild wishes to speak with you about Randgar.\n2\tTalk to Randgar\tRandgar has returned and is awaiting outside his farm. Randgar has appeared, alive and well, and would like to explain things to you.\n3\tTalk to Inhild\tInhild can be found near Randgar's farm. Inhild wishes to discuss one final matter with you.\n",
})
